      "The quoted-container tie-break then boosts CLASS whenever any quoted shared deployment container and any entity declaration coexist, without checking whether the remaining source stays class-consumable (crates/rustuml-parser/src/parse/mod.rs:777-789).",
      "That shortcut matches simple entity-only controls, but it does not model Java's whole-source viability once a nested component line requires DescriptionDiagramFactory or allowmixing."
